// YAML Spec (Simplified)
// - Node: Word ":" (Space) Value
// - Value: String | Number | Boolean
// ---------------------------------------------------------
$Y( @_ $N(@w @_ ":" @_ $V(@.|@"|@b|@B|@w) @_)* )
// ---------------------------------------------------------
// MicroPEG Breakdown
//
// Snails (Helper Utilities):
// @"       double quoted string parser
// @.       number parser
// @b       boolean 'true'|'false'
// @B       case insensitive boolean 'true'|'false'
// @w       alphanumeric word parser
// @_       optional whitespace parser (skips spaces, tabs, newlines)
//
// Symbols:
// $Y       label (Yaml)
// (        grouping
// @_       snail helper (Whitespace)
// $N       label (Node)
// (        grouping
// @w       snail helper (Key)
// @_       snail helper (Whitespace)
// ":"      literal string
// @_       snail helper (Whitespace)
// $V       label (Value)
// (        grouping
// @.       snail helper (Number)
// |        or junction
// @"       snail helper (String)
// |        or junction
// @b       snail helper (Boolean)
// |        or junction
// @B       snail helper (Case-insensitive Boolean)
// |        or junction
// @w       snail helper (Unquoted String)
// )        end grouping
// @_       snail helper (Whitespace)
// )        end grouping
// *        zero or more
// )        end grouping
